Write-Host "Done. Bazaar is OFF until you set BAZAAR_ENABLED=1." -ForegroundColor Green
Write-Host ""
Write-Host "Local test needs THREE terminals - note the FACILITATOR_URL override:" -ForegroundColor Cyan
Write-Host "  1)  npm run stub-facilitator -- --bazaar --rival"
Write-Host "  2)  `$env:FACILITATOR_URL=`"http://localhost:4099`"; `$env:BAZAAR_ENABLED=`"1`"; npm run dev"
Write-Host "  3)  `$env:FACILITATOR_URL=`"http://localhost:4099`""
Write-Host "      npm run bazaar:list -- --mine http://localhost:4020 --tag 3d-asset"
Write-Host "      npm run agent:discover -- thumbnail"
Write-Host ""
Write-Host "Without the override the scripts query the REAL facilitator, which knows" -ForegroundColor Yellow
Write-Host "nothing about a localhost deployment." -ForegroundColor Yellow
Write-Host ""
Write-Host "See BAZAAR.md for the full picture." -ForegroundColor Cyan
Write-Host ""